== Source location ==
Publisher: the Players Committee; obtained from its [[Holotable]] Git repository, not from the 2007 gallery recovery. Full source: [https://raw.githubusercontent.com/swccgpc/holotable/022435b7929e4de26dafbcb1de2ec1d6d04d2153/Images-HT/starwars/Dagobah-Dark/large/captainneeda.gif exact GIF at immutable commit]. Repository member: <code>Images-HT/starwars/Dagobah-Dark/large/captainneeda.gif</code>, commit <code style="overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-all;">022435b7929e4de26dafbcb1de2ec1d6d04d2153</code>. The 8 July 2018 commit imports an existing image set; that is not established as the original publication day. Uploaded bytes are unchanged.